.TH "InitArena" "3" "2026\-10\-07" "arena" "Arena Manuals"
.SH NAME
\fBInitArena\fR \- init \fBArena\fR(3type) struct.\&
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fB#include "arena.\&h"\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBArena* InitArena(size_t \fIinit_cap\fB);\fR
.fi
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBInitArena\fR inits \fBArena\fR(3type) struct with \fIinit_cap\fR size.\&
.PP
\fIinit_cap\fR
.RS 4
Initial capacity of arena.\&
.RE
.PP
.SH RETURN VALUE
Return value is pointer to \fBArena\fR(3type) struct or NULL if can't allocate memory with \fBmalloc\fR(3).\&
.PP
.SH AUTHORS
Project and man\-page: TheCRatTime.\&
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBarena\fR(3), \fBArena\fR(3type), \fBFreeArena\fR(3), \fBArenaReset\fR(3), \fBArenaAlloc\fR(3)
